{"id": "34449", "title": "改造娇妻大作战", "author": "橙星", "category": "文学名著", "count": 54, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34449.htm", "intro": "好啦！他承认，自己是不应该有偏见，还是很不应该的偏见，但他也不是故意的，他就是偏爱……那一款咩！而当命运之神好死不死的替他送来“猎物”，他哪可能拱手让人？！当然是要据理力争，抵死也得把她给骗到手啰！更别说经过一番相处，他对她的无论是个性、脾气、态度全都爱不释手，唯一的难处就是：他喜欢的，她却想“修正”！这可是很大的挑战，他非努力的替她洗脑，让她同意做个“原汁原味”的真女人不可。却没想到，他的一番苦心却被有心人士利用，硬是想绑架她，替她“变身”，气得他只能展开爱的绝地大反击……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34449", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2186577.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2186578.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2186579.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2186580.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2186581.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2186582.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2186583.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2186584.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2186585.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2186586.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2186587.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2186588.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2186589.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2186590.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2186591.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2186592.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2186593.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2186594.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2186595.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2186596.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2186597.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2186598.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2186599.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2186600.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", 